## Architecture

| File | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `main.go` | Interactive REPL and slash command dispatch |
| `config.go` | Persistent user config, provider presets, and live config updates |
| `agent.go` | State machine, context pruning, tool dispatch, system prompt |
| `shell.go` / `shell_unix.go` / `shell_generic.go` | Termux shell resolver, timeout execution, and process-group killing |
| `patch.go` | Exact search/replace and diff-block extraction |
| `provider.go` | OpenAI-compatible request/response translation with custom header injection |
| `ui.go` | Minimal ANSI spinner with low refresh rate |

## Security Notes

- `apply_search_replace` is restricted to the current working directory and `HOME` to prevent path traversal.
- `execute_command` runs in a new process group and is killed with `SIGKILL` on timeout to mitigate Phantom Process Killer side effects.
